  "basis": [
    "Base06.writeItemNBT preserves covers on host; Base04.getDrops uses item data rather than full world save. Native destruction must produce one packed host and zero duplicate loose cover items.",
    "BasicMachine.writeItemNBT2:250-256 writes mode/IO flags, not pending work. Current tests separately check world-save pending output delivery and exclude progress/inventory from ordinary block drop. Existing unimplemented mode/IO settings are not certified by this batch.",
    "LargeTurbine and converter chains save fluids/energy/stopped to world NBT, not item NBT. World-save checks and existing cover-only harvest sanitizer are tested separately.",
    "DustFunnel.canExtractItem2 only permits output slot 1. Input remains present across invalidation/revive and is manually retrievable exactly once; automated input extraction stays forbidden.",
    "Forge ComponentCoverCapabilitiesMixin and ForgeCoverCapabilityCache add per-face cached views over shared burning-box sinks. All issued item/fluid views must invalidate; front item refusal remains.",
    "Controller fixtures inject before ticking. Previously stopped machines reject pre-tick energy; waking/timer tests allow next injection after control refresh. Processing and standby running are distinct states.",
    "Pressure valve vent uses a real single-channel pipe and actual server tick, loaded/ticking dedicated template and an entity visible to the native vent query. No direct damage helper substitutes for the vent."
  ],
